 "desc": "Plan a cattle handling system that improves safety, workflow, capacity, and efficiency with practical equipment and layout tips.",
 "excerpt": "A well-planned cattle handling system can change the way an entire operation runs. It affects how calmly cattle move, how safely people work, how long routine procedures…",
